## Failures

### Fixed: unfilled track 1.09:1 light, 1.31:1 dark - was LOW
Location: `src/components/slider/Slider.scss:55`, token `slider.track.bg`.
Before: `rgb(245,245,245)` on white 1.09:1; `rgb(38,38,38)` on `rgb(10,10,10)` 1.31:1.
After: maps to `color.input`, `rgb(115,115,115)`: 4.74:1 light, 4.18:1 dark; contract pair `slider.track.bg` vs `color.background` added (T6 passes); range and thumb still distinct (screenshots).

### Fixed: track and range disappeared in forced-colors mode - was MEDIUM
Location: `src/components/slider/Slider.scss:67` and `:91`.
Before: both computed `rgb(255, 255, 255)` (Canvas); only thumb rings visible.
After: track `GrayText` (`rgb(96, 0, 0)`), range `Highlight` (`rgba(5, 0, 73, 0.8)`), distinct from Canvas and each other; spec 'in forced colors the track and the filled range stay visible and distinct' passes.

### Fixed: fill on the wrong side in RTL - was MEDIUM
Location: `src/components/slider/Slider.scss:86` (`inset-inline-start`).
Before: `dir=rtl`, Volume 40: fill from the left edge (`rangeLeft` 0) while the thumb sat 40% from the right.
After: fill starts at the right edge (single) and tracks the thumbs (range 10,40); spec 'RTL fills from the inline start, on the right' passes.

